1
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
The flavor you know. The story you don't.

2
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Flamin' Hot is a drama, history film directed by Eva Longoria.

3
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
The inspiring true story of Richard Montañez, the Frito Lay janitor who channeled his Mexican American heritage and upbringing to turn
the iconic Flamin' Hot Cheetos into a snack that disrupted the food industry and became a global pop culture phenomenon.

4
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Richard Montañez, played by Jesse García.

5
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Judy Montañez, played by Annie Gonzalez.

6
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:06,000
Vacho Montañez, played by Emilio Rivera.

7
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:36,000
Concha Montañez, played by Vanessa Martinez.

8
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Clarence C. Baker, played by Dennis Haysbert.

9
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Roger Enrico, played by Tony Shalhoub.

10
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Flamin' Hot is a 2023 American biographical comedy-drama film directed
by Eva Longoria in her feature-length directorial debut.

11
01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Written by Linda Yvette Chávez and Lewis Colick, it is based on the memoir A Boy, a Burrito and a Cookie:
From Janitor to Executive by Richard Montañez, who claims to have invented Flamin' Hot Cheetos.

12
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
The film stars Jesse Garcia, Annie Gonzalez, Dennis Haysbert, and Tony Shalhoub.

13
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
The film had its world premiere at South by Southwest on March 11, 2023.

14
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
It was released on June 9, 2023, by Hulu and
Disney+ to mixed reviews from critics.

15
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
At the 96th Academy Awards, Flamin' Hot received a nomination for Best Original Song for "The Fire
Inside" written by Diane Warren, but lost to “What Was I Made For?” from Barbie.

16
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film explores themes of biography, based on true story,
janitor, mexican american, woman director.

17
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:36,000
The tone is uplifting and emotional.
